I promise.  We'll talk.  You'll be great.  You'll be fine.  Go ahead, just imagine that, uh... Just look into the lens and imagine you're talking to me.
ຂ້ອຍສັນຍາ. ພວກເຮົາຈະເວົ້າ. ເຈົ້າຈະເປັນດີເລີດ. ເຈົ້າຈະດີດີ. ໄປກ່ອນ,
